name: ['Act of Treason', 'Aquamorph Entity', 'Arc Trail', 'Arcanis the Omnipotent', 'Arrow Volley Trap', 'Banefire', 'Beetleback Chief', 'Bone Splinters', 'Coral Trickster', 'Dauntless Onslaught', 'Dregscape Zombie', 'Echo Tracer', 'Evolving Wilds', 'Faerie Impostor', 'Faerie Invaders', 'Fathom Seer', 'Fiery Fall', 'Flame-Kin Zealot', 'Fleeting Distraction', 'Fleshbag Marauder', 'Frenzied Goblin', 'Fury of the Horde', 'Ghitu Encampment', 'Goblin Bombardment', 'Goblin Deathraiders', 'Goblin Warchief', "Hell's Thunder", 'Hellraiser Goblin', 'Hold the Line', 'Hussar Patrol', 'Impulse', 'Infantry Veteran', 'Inferno Trap', 'Island', 'Jeskai Elder', 'Kathari Bomber', 'Kor Hookmaster', "Krenko's Command", 'Krenko, Mob Boss', 'Leonin Snarecaster', 'Lightning Angel', 'Lightning Helix', 'Lone Missionary', 'Mana Leak', 'Mardu Heart-Piercer', 'Master Decoy', 'Mountain', 'Mystic Monastery', 'Nomad Outpost', 'Ogre Battledriver', 'Oni of Wild Places', 'Orcish Cannonade', 'Plains', 'Reckless Abandon', 'Repeal', 'Scourge Devil', 'Shambling Remains', 'Shock', 'Sparkmage Apprentice', 'Sphinx of Uthuun', 'Stave Off', 'Steam Augury', 'Stonecloaker', 'Swamp', 'Swift Justice', 'Terramorphic Expanse', 'Thousand Winds', 'Traumatic Visions', 'Whiplash Trap', 'Willbender', 'Zurgo Helmsmasher']
