text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Arc Trail deals 2 damage to any target and 1 damage to another target.', 'As Aquamorph Entity enters the battlefield or is turned face up, it becomes your choice of 5/1 or 1/5.\\nMorph {2}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nDestroy target creature.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nReckless Abandon deals 4 damage to any target.', "Banefire deals X damage to any target.\\nIf X is 5 or more, this spell can't be countered and the damage can't be prevented.", 'Blocking creatures get +7/+7 until end of turn.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', 'Counter target spell.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{U} ({1}{U}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'Creatures you control have haste and attack each combat if able.', 'Fiery Fall deals 5 damage to target creature.\\nBasic landcycling {1}{R} ({1}{R}, Discard this card: Search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.)', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nFlying', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)\\nVigilance', "Flash\\nFlying\\nWhen Stonecloaker enters the battlefield, return a creature you control to its owner's hand.\\nWhen Stonecloaker enters the battlefield, exile target card from a graveyard.", "Flying, haste\\nAt the beginning of the end step, sacrifice Hell's Thunder.\\nUnearth {4}{R} ({4}{R}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)", 'Flying, vigilance, haste', "Flying\\nMorph {5}{U}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Thousand Winds is turned face up, return all other tapped creatures to their owners' hands.", "Flying\\nWhen Faerie Impostor enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you return another creature you control to its owner's hand.", 'Flying\\nWhen Kathari Bomber deals combat damage to a player, create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens and sacrifice Kathari Bomber.\\nUnearth {3}{B}{R} ({3}{B}{R}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'Flying\\nWhen Sphinx of Uthuun enters the battlefield, reveal the top five cards of your library. An opponent separates those cards into two piles. Put one pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', "Ghitu Encampment enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R}.\\n{1}{R}: Ghitu Encampment becomes a 2/1 red Warrior creature with first strike until end of turn. It's still a land. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)", 'Goblin spells you cast cost {1} less to cast.\\nGoblins you control have haste.', "Haste\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, return a red creature you control to its owner's hand.", "Haste\\nZurgo Helmsmasher attacks each combat if able.\\nZurgo Helmsmasher has indestructible as long as it's your turn.\\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Zurgo Helmsmasher this turn dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Zurgo Helmsmasher.", "If an opponent had two or more creatures enter the battlefield under their control this turn, you may pay {U} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nReturn two target creatures to their owners' hands.", "If four or more creatures are attacking, you may pay {1}{W} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nArrow Volley Trap deals 5 damage divided as you choose among any number of target attacking creatures.", "If you've been dealt damage by two or more creatures this turn, you may pay {R} rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nInferno Trap deals 4 damage to target creature.", 'Lightning Helix deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life.', 'Look at the top four cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Morph {1}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Willbender is turned face up, change the target of target spell or ability with a single target.', "Morph {2}{U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Echo Tracer is turned face up, return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Morph {U} (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Coral Trickster is turned face up, you may tap or untap target permanent.', "Morph—Return two Islands you control to their owner's hand. (You may cast this card face down as a 2/2 creature for {3}. Turn it face up any time for its morph cost.)\\nWhen Fathom Seer is turned face up, draw two cards.", 'Mystic Monastery enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U}, {R}, or {W}.', 'Nomad Outpost enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R}, {W}, or {B}.', 'Orcish Cannonade deals 2 damage to any target and 3 damage to you.\\nDraw a card.', 'Prowess (Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, this creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.)\\nWhenever Jeskai Elder deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card. If you do, discard a card.', 'Raid — When Mardu Heart-Piercer enters the battlefield, if you attacked this turn, Mardu Heart-Piercer deals 2 damage to any target.', "Return target nonland permanent with mana value X to its owner's hand.\\nDraw a card.", 'Reveal the top five cards of your library and separate them into two piles. An opponent chooses one of those piles. Put that pile into your hand and the other into your graveyard.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Goblin Bombardment deals 1 damage to any target.', "Shambling Remains can't block.\\nUnearth {B}{R} ({B}{R}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)", 'Shock deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Target creature gains protection from the color of your choice until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -1/-0 until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Trample', 'Unearth {B} ({B}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'Until end of turn, target creature gets +1/+0 and gains first strike and lifelink.', 'Up to two target creatures each get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'When Beetleback Chief enters the battlefield, create two 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens.', 'When Flame-Kin Zealot enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain haste until end of turn.', 'When Fleshbag Marauder enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature.', "When Kor Hookmaster enters the battlefield, tap target creature an opponent controls. That creature doesn't untap during its controller's next untap step.", 'When Leonin Snarecaster enters the battlefield, you may tap target creature.', 'When Lone Missionary enters the battlefield, you gain 4 life.', 'When Scourge Devil enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.\\nUnearth {2}{R} ({2}{R}: Return this card from your graveyard to the battlefield. It gains haste. Exile it at the beginning of the next end step or if it would leave the battlefield. Unearth only as a sorcery.)', 'When Sparkmage Apprentice enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to any target.', "Whenever Frenzied Goblin attacks, you may pay {R}. If you do, target creature can't block this turn.", 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, that creature gets +2/+0 and gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', "You may exile two red cards from your hand rather than pay this spell's mana cost.\\nUntap all creatures that attacked this turn. After this main phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase.", '{T}, Sacrifice Evolving Wilds: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}, Sacrifice Terramorphic Expanse: Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', '{T}: Create X 1/1 red Goblin creature tokens, where X is the number of Goblins you control.', "{T}: Draw three cards.\\n{2}{U}{U}: Return Arcanis the Omnipotent to its owner's hand.", '{T}: Target attacking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.']
flavor: ['"Crispy! Scarback! Load another volcano-ball."\\n—Stumphobbler Thuj, orcish captain', '"Do not concern yourself with my origin, my race, or my ancestry. Seek my record in the pits, and then make your wager."', '"Do you smell something burning?"', '"Don\'t try to hit your enemies. Concentrate on the space between them, and fill the air with doom."\\n—Spear-Tribe teaching', '"For us, a rope represents the ties that bind the kor. For you, it\'s more literal."', '"Forgive me, Master Kami, but in the interest of my people I must halt your advance."', '"Having conviction is more important than being righteous."\\n—Aurelia', '"He displays a perverse charisma fueled by avarice. Highly dangerous. Recommend civil sanctions."\\n—Agmand Sarv, Azorius hussar', '"Only the weak imprison themselves behind walls. We live free under the wind, and our freedom makes us strong."\\n—Zurgo, khan of the Mardu', '"Rage courses in every heart, yearning to betray its rational prison."\\n—Sarkhan Vol', '"Swords, to me! We must engage their line to protect our archers and mages. Let no one fail this task!"', '"The beauty of it is they never see it coming. Ever."\\n—Razzix, sparkmage', '"The people of Akros must learn from our leonin adversaries. If we match their staunch ferocity with our superior faith, we cannot fail."\\n—Cymede, queen of Akros', '"Those who have never ridden before the wind do not know the true joy of war."', '"You call it luck. I call it preparation."', '"You think no one is watching, you think you\'re smart enough to escape, and most foolish of all, you think no one cares."\\n—Arrester Lavinia, Tenth Precinct', '"Your deed cannot be undone. You, however, can be."\\n—Agosto, Azorius imperator', 'A skilled decoy can throw your enemies off your trail. A master decoy can survive to do it again.', 'Boros soldiers are like a cache of bombs ready to explode, and the flame-kin light their fuses.', "Don't let him lead the soldiers, but by all means let him lead the way.", "Every once in a while, when they aren't getting incinerated in lava, crushed under rock slides, or devoured by dragons, goblins experience moments of unmitigated glory in battle.", "For Sarkhan Vol, the dragon is the purest expression of life's savage splendor.", 'Formerly oppressed by the polis of Meletis, leonin occasionally "mistake" their old enemies for game.', 'Goblins are eager to follow orders, especially when those orders involve stealing, hurting, annoying, eating, destroying, or swearing.', 'Grixis is a world where the only things found in abundance are death and decay. Corpses, whole or in part, are the standard currency among necromancers and demons.', 'His mission has become a grim pilgrimage, a tour of the Eldrazi-stricken outposts across Zendikar. But he marches on alone, stubborn as the daily dawn.', 'Jund feasts on the unprepared.', 'Keranos is a fickle god, delivering punishment as readily as prophecy.', 'Many Tin Street shops display a sign on the door: "No cloaks allowed."', 'Ogres are driven by passion, rage, and another ogre standing behind them with a whip.', 'Small enough to penetrate the narrowest crack in a castle wall and numerous enough to hack apart a griffin.', 'Sparkmages are performance artists of sorts, but pain is the price of admission.', 'Sudden vengeance, echoing fury.', 'Take two steps north into the unsettled future, south into the unquiet past, east into the present day, or west into the great unknown.', "The climax of a warlord's career is always death.", 'The fatal flaw in every plan is the assumption that you know more than your enemy.', 'The first spell taught to young mages, it has spared the lives of many whose hands are too small to hold a sword.', 'The oni leapt easily from peak to peak, toying with its victims, its voice a purr from the rumbling depths of nightmare.', 'The undead of Grixis are fueled by their hatred of the living.', "The upside to not thinking about the consequences is that you'll always surprise those who do.", 'They poured from the Skirk Ridge like lava, burning and devouring everything in their path.', 'They wait in darkened depths, laughing eagerly.', "Though less well-known than its army of soldiers, the Boros Legion's mage-priests are as respected by the innocent as they are hated by the ghosts of the guilty.", 'When asked how many paths reach enlightenment, the monk kicked a heap of sand. "Count," he smiled, "and then find more grains."', 'Whether trained, ridden, or eaten, few goblin military innovations have rivaled the bug.', 'Witches of the Split-Eye Coven speak of a future when Grixis will overflow with life energy. For now, they must harvest vis from the living to fuel their dark magics.', 'With one motion, a pest is removed and a scourge inflicted.', 'Without the interfering hands of civilization, nature will always shape itself to its own needs.']
artist: ['Adam Paquette', 'Andreas Rocha', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Arnie Swekel', 'Ben Thompson', 'Brian Despain', 'Carl Critchlow', 'Cole Eastburn', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'D. Alexander Gregory', 'Daarken', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Dave Kendall', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Eric Peterson', 'Florian de Gesincourt', 'Greg Hildebrandt & Tim Hildebrandt', 'Greg Staples', 'Howard Lyon', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'Johann Bodin', 'John Avon', 'Jon Foster', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Jung Park', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kekai Kotaki', 'Kev Walker', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Marc Simonetti', 'Mark Tedin', 'Mark Zug', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Pete Venters', 'Peter Mohrbacher', 'Philip Straub', 'Ralph Horsley', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Rob Alexander', 'Ron Spears', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Stephen Tappin', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Tomas Giorello', 'Wayne England', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Zoltan Boros', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai', 'rk post']
